@startuml 01e-component-stage-layering
!include ../_style.iuml
title Pi-Gen imaging: rootfs layering, what each stage contributes

component S0 [
<b>stage0  (upstream, bootstrap)</b>
prerun.sh: debootstrap trixie
00-configure-apt: RPi apt repo + key
01-locale
02-firmware: kernel + firmware
]
component S1 [
<b>stage1  (upstream, minimal bootable)</b>
00-boot-files: cmdline.txt, config.txt
01-sys-tweaks: first user, fstab
02-net-tweaks: hostname
03-install-packages
]
component S2 [
<b>stage2  (upstream, Raspberry Pi OS Lite)</b>
00-copies-and-fills
01-sys-tweaks: ssh, sudo, NetworkManager
02-net-tweaks
03-set-timezone, 03-accept-mathematica-eula
04-cloud-init
EXPORT_IMAGE <i>removed by _pigen-podman.sh</i>
]
component S35 [
<b>stage3, stage4, stage5</b>
desktop variants
SKIP + SKIP_IMAGES, not in STAGE_LIST
]
component SI [
<b>stages/stage-ivalice-base  (this repo)</b>
prerun.sh: copy_previous (stage2 rootfs)
00-ivalice-base/00-packages: ~50 debs
  slurmctld, slurmd, munge, libpmix2, ansible-core,
  cloud-init, podman, avahi, zsh, neovim, build tools
00-ivalice-base/01-run.sh: files/ overlay, userconf.txt,
  airgap assets into rootfs, chroot service config (see 01f)
EXPORT_IMAGE: IMG_SUFFIX=""
]
component EX [
<b>export-image  (upstream)</b>
00-allow-rerun, 01-user-rename, 02-set-sources,
03-network, 04-set-partuuid, 05-finalise
]
artifact IMG [
<b>deploy/<date>-ivalice.img</b>
bootfs (FAT) + rootfs (ext4)
]

S0 --> S1 : rootfs
S1 --> S2 : rootfs
S2 --> SI : rootfs
S35 ..> SI : skipped
SI --> EX : EXPORT_DIRS
EX --> IMG

note right of SI
  This is the only custom stage. There is no
  10-sphinx-asr sub-stage yet (CLAUDE.md lists one),
  so the image does not contain sphinx-asr.
end note
@enduml
